@startuml
[*] -> Logged Out: login attempt

Logged Out:
    on login -> Main Menu

Main Menu:
    on market conditions -> Market Conditions
    on pest control help -> Pest Control Help (Photo Required)
    on soil info -> Soil Suggestions
    on weather insights -> Weather Insights
    on labour availability -> Labour Availability

Market Conditions:
    on back -> Main Menu
    on logout -> Logged Out

Pest Control Help (Photo Required):
    on photo provided -> Pest Control Techniques
    on back -> Main Menu
    on logout -> Logged Out

Soil Suggestions:
    on soil info submitted -> Soil Suggestions
    on back -> Main Menu
    on logout -> Logged Out

Weather Insights:
    on location provided -> Weather Insights
    on back -> Main Menu
    on logout -> Logged Out

Labour Availability:
    on location provided -> Labour Availability
    on back -> Main Menu
    on logout -> Logged Out

Main
@enduml
